          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani kiburakinosi ŋituŋa, ido towan ipei ŋinice kerae ka amoru, kori tonaŋ nai nyetwana ŋini ewanitae, ido yaarae kimadae ka ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toŋaleu tolomu kiŋa icoge ke ebela, nyemaikina toarae ikawanan, nai emaikina iŋes totac apaki ŋina ecanican ŋin eperi ka emaikina iŋes kidar ŋin tari ŋina eŋaleunio ejok jik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani kewan ekapolon epito, kori apito keŋ ke ebela, ido totwan apaki ŋinapei ewanere, emaikina kisicanae ekapolon ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani kiboi epito ŋol, kori apito ŋin akoloŋit apei, kori ŋirwa ŋiarei nyetwana, mam nyisicanio ekapolon ŋol; anerae agyelit ekapolon ŋol epito ŋol, kori apito ŋin ka arae ŋolo keŋ, kori ŋina keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani kewana ŋituŋa ŋulu ejiete aberu ŋina epoti tobwaŋut akook, ido nyitiyakin ŋace naberu ŋin, itatacio ekawanan aberu ŋin ibore ŋini etemari ekile ka aberu a ŋin tolemunae, ido tocamunite eikiiko daadaŋ ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani kewanitae aberu ŋin nooi, emaikina iyes tolemasi akiyar aŋuna ka akiyar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
